{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Wisdom 17 or higher\n\nYou sharpen your gaze as you focus your ranged attacks to become effective. When you spend your action to prepare your shot, your next ranged attack is made with advantage, and if it hits, it counts as critical. You can use this feature once per short or long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customd83ab8ed-01fa-4090-80c1-582c46726691","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Deadeye [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}